   "body": "Done in #478 (merged as 84771d1).\n\n**Left for the maintainer:** re-import the `dev-swift` ruleset. Either:\n- Settings → Rules → Rulesets → \"SwiftHFR dev-swift\": remove \"Analyze (swift)\" and add \"App build + tests (iOS 27 simulator)\";\n- or run `./scripts/configure-repo.sh`.\n\nThe `codeql` label already exists on the repository. Until the re-import, nothing blocks a merge: a skipped \"Analyze (swift)\" counts as passed. The app check is not enforced yet, so cloud/orch still checks it by hand.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
